@base_url = http://localhost:8082
@access_token =
@refresh_token =

### ============================================
### chat-abavava-java — HTTP Client
###
### IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client для вызова API.
###
### Переключение окружения:
###   1. Нажми Ctrl+Shift+P (или Cmd+Shift+P на Mac)
###   2. Выбери окружение: dev, local, prod
###   3. Все запросы автоматически подхватят новый URL
###
### Демо-данные (ABV_SEED=true):
###   anya@example.com / password123
###   pavel@example.com / password123
###   test / test
### ============================================

### --- Аутентификация ---

### 1. Регистрация нового пользователя
### POST /api/v1/auth/register
### 201 Created
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tssv85@gmail.com",
  "display_name": "slaffka85",
  "password": "1"
}

### 1. Регистрация нового пользователя
### POST /api/v1/auth/register
### 201 Created
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "javadevelopersamara85@gmail.com",
  "display_name": "developer",
  "password": "1"
}

> {%
  client.assert(response.status === 201, "Expected 201, got " + response.status);
  client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
  client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
  client.log("Registered. Token: " + response.body.access_token.substring(0, 30) + "...");
%}

### 2. Логин
### POST /api/v1/auth/login
### 200 OK
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tssv85@gmail.com",
  "password": "1"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
  client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
  client.log("Logged in. Token: " + response.body.access_token.substring(0, 30) + "...");
%}

### 3. Обновление refresh-токена
### POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
### 200 OK
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
  client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
  client.log("Token refreshed.");
%}

### 4. Выход (logout)
### POST /api/v1/auth/logout
### 204 No Content
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

> {%
  client.assert(response.status === 204, "Expected 204, got " + response.status);
  client.log("Logged out.");
%}

### --- Пользователи ---

### 5. Профиль текущего пользователя
### GET /api/v1/me
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 6. Обновить профиль
### PATCH /api/v1/me
### 200 OK
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/v1/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "display_name": "New Name"
}

### 7. Список пользователей
### GET /api/v1/users
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 8. Пользователь по ID
### GET /api/v1/users/{id}
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### --- Чаты ---

### 9. Список диалогов (keyset-пагинация)
### GET /api/v1/conversations
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 10. Создать прямой диалог
### POST /api/v1/conversations
### 200/201 Created
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "kind": "direct",
  "member_ids": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
}

### 11. Создать группу
### POST /api/v1/conversations
### 201 Created
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "kind": "group",
  "title": "Test Group",
  "member_ids": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
}

### 12. Информация о диалоге
### GET /api/v1/conversations/{id}
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 13. Отправить сообщение (идемпотентно через client_id)
### POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages
### 201 Created
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "client_id": "{{[uuid]}}",
  "body": "Hello from IntelliJ HTTP Client!"
}

### 14. История сообщений
### GET /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 15. Отметить прочитанным
### POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/read
### 204 No Content
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/read
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "cursor": 100
}

### 16. Отправить событие "печатает"
### POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/typing
### 204 No Content
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/typing
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "typing": true
}

### --- Звонки ---

### 17. Создать звонок
### POST /api/v1/calls
### 201 Created
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/calls
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "peer_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "kind": "audio"
}

### 18. Список звонков
### GET /api/v1/calls
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/calls?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 19. Принять звонок
### POST /api/v1/calls/{id}/accept
### 200 OK
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/calls/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{}

### 20. Завершить звонок
### POST /api/v1/calls/{id}/end
### 200 OK
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/calls/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/end
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{}

### --- Конфигурация и статус ---

### 21. ICE-конфигурация (STUN/TURN)
### GET /api/v1/config/ice
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/config/ice

### 22. Health check
### GET /healthz
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/healthz

### 23. Ready check (пингует БД)
### GET /readyz
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/readyz

### 24. Статус API (online users)
### GET /api/v1/status
### 200 OK
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/status

### --- Участники диалога ---

### 25. Добавить участника
### POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/members
### 204 No Content
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "user_ids": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
}

### 26. Удалить участника
### DELETE /api/v1/conversations/{id}/members/{user_id}
### 204 No Content
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/members/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
